# Code owners for Sync Gateway.
#
# A PR needs approval from at least one owner of each path it touches. Every
# area has two owners, so no single person has to approve a change. A PR author
# can't approve their own PR, so the other owner reviews it.
#
# The last pattern that matches a path wins. The top-level defaults come first,
# and the more specific patterns after them override those defaults.

# Anything not listed below.
*                                       @bbrks @torcolvin @gregns1

